<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>
  <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
  <p>Someone tried to sign up on StreamTube using this email address, but you already have an account with us.</p>
  <p>If this was you, you can just log in:</p>
  <p><a href="{{loginUrl}}">Log in</a></p>
  <p>Forgot your password? You can reset it here:</p>
  <p><a href="{{forgotPasswordUrl}}">Reset my password</a></p>
  <p>Haven't confirmed your account yet? Request a new confirmation link here:</p>
  <p><a href="{{resendConfirmationUrl}}">Resend confirmation email</a></p>
  <p>If you did not try to sign up, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
  <p>The StreamTube Team</p>
</body>
</html>
